  },
  {
   "location": "right side (1888-1891)",
   "fact": "The line dips slightly in 1888 to ~2,250, then climbs sharply to its highest point of ~3,200 in 1891."
  },
  {
   "location": "entire series",
   "fact": "Despite the title saying 'Decreasing', the visual data shows a net increase from ~1,100 in 1880 to ~3,200 in 1891."
